</node>
<node id="9543">
  <data key="d0">event</data>
  <data key="d1">9543</data>
  <data key="d2">Dagstuhl Seminar</data>
  <data key="d3">Modelling and Simulation of Gene and Cell Regulation</data>
  <data key="d4">1995-10-23</data>
  <data key="d5">1995-10-27</data>
  <data key="d6">https://www.dagstuhl.de/9543</data>
  <data key="d7"></data>
  <data key="d8">
 &lt;p&gt;During the workshop 31 lectures which covered various topics have been presented by participants from different countries. All participants appreciated the stimulating and cordial atmosphere at Schloss Dagstuhl. The always engaged support of the Dagstuhl team was an essential
contribution to the success of this seminar.&lt;/p&gt; 
 &lt;p&gt;The organizers wish to thank the VW-Stiftung for its generous financial support and all those
who helped to make the workshop an interesting and fruitful research experience.&lt;/p&gt; 
