  <data key="d12">Computer arithmetic; arbitrary precision; floating-point arithmetic standardization; language support; reliable libraries; high-precision special functions; reliablealgorithms; reliable floating-point and interval computing on different platforms</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</node>
