                    Diego Calvanese, Sven Hartmann, and Ernest Teniente
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
  <data key="d9"></data>
  <data key="d10">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.3.5.43</data>
  <data key="d11">software engineering; verification / logic</data>
  <data key="d12">Automated Reasoning; Conceptual Schema of an Information System; Validation; Verification</data>
