                    Stephen A. Edwards and Alain Girault and Klaus Schneider
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
  <data key="d9">https://doi.org/10.1145/2997465.2997467</data>
  <data key="d10">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.3.11.117</data>
  <data key="d11">modelling / simulation; programming languages / compiler; semantics / formal methods</data>
  <data key="d12">synchronous and asynchronous languages; model-based design; discrete and hybrid systems; compilation and code synthesis for embedded systems; execution time analysis; safety-critical real-time systems</data>
