                    Glenn S. Dardick, Barbara Endicott-Popovsky, Pavel Gladyshev, Thomas Kemmerich, and Carsten Rudolph
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
  <data key="d9">http://dx.doi.org/10.1007/978-3-319-40253-6_15; http://www.degruyter.com/view/j/itit.2015.57.issue-6/issue-files/itit.2015.57.issue-6.xml</data>
  <data key="d10">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.4.2.150</data>
