                    Pierre Dillenbourg, Claude Kirchner, John C. Mitchell, and Martin Wirsing
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
  <data key="d9">http://dx.doi.org/10.1007/s00287-014-0812-6</data>
  <data key="d10">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.4.3.47; https://doi.org/10.4230/DagMan.4.1.1</data>
