  <data key="d10">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.4.6.48</data>
  <data key="d11">programming languages / compiler; semantics / formal methods; verification / logic</data>
  <data key="d12">executable analysis; reverse engineering; self-modifying code; malware analysis</data>
