                    Ulrich Carsten Meyer, Henning Meyerhenke, Ali Pinar, and Ilya Safro
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
  <data key="d9"></data>
  <data key="d10">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.4.11.40</data>
