                    Katrien De Moor, Markus Fiedler, Peter Reichl, and Martín Varela
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
  <data key="d9">http://dx.doi.org/10.1007/s00287-015-0907-8; http://dx.doi.org/10.1109/ICCW.2015.7247432; http://dx.doi.org/10.1109/QoMEX.2015.7148142; http://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s41233-016-0002-1/fulltext.html; http://dx.doi.org/10.1109/QoMEX.2015.7148138</data>
