 &lt;div&gt;
&lt;img alt="Copyright" src="https://www.dagstuhl.de/_Resources/Static/Packages/Dagstuhl.Site/Frontend/images/licenses/copy.png?bust=22575bbf" style="width: 1em;"/&gt;

                    Salvatore Greco, Kathrin Klamroth, Joshua D. Knowles, and Günter Rudolph
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
  <data key="d9">http://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/mcda.v24.1-2/issuetoc</data>
  <data key="d10">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.5.1.96</data>
  <data key="d11">modelling / simulation; optimization / scheduling; soft computing / evolutionary algorithms</data>
  <data key="d12">multi-criteria optimization; multiple criterion decision making; evolutionary multiobjective optimization; MCDM; EMO; hybrid methods; complexity</data>
