                    Aicke Hinrichs, Joseph F. Traub, Henryk Wozniakowski, and Larisa Yaroslavtseva
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
  <data key="d9">http://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0893608015001756; http://www.ricam.oeaw.ac.at/files/reports/16/rep16-09.pdf; https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jat.2017.05.003; https://arxiv.org/abs/1608.00906; http://journals.sagepub.com/doi/pdf/10.1177/1932296816670400; http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.cmpb.2016.07.003</data>
