                    Jan-Philip Steghöfer and Ada Diaconescu and Stephen Marsh and Jeremy Pitt and Wolfgang Reif
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
  <data key="d9">http://ieeexplore.ieee.org/stamp/stamp.jsp?tp=&amp;arnumber=8038122</data>
  <data key="d10">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.5.11.127</data>
  <data key="d11">artificial intelligence / robotics; society / human-computer interaction; soft computing / evolutionary algorithms</data>
