                    Giuseppe F. Italiano, Bettina Speckmann, Guy Theraulaz, and Marc van Kreveld
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
  <data key="d9">http://csconferences.mah.se/eurocg2017/proceedings.pdf; https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pcbi.1005822; http://arxiv.org/abs/1604.06089</data>
  <data key="d10">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.6.1.55</data>
