                    Tony Clark, Ulrich Frank, and Vinay Kulkarni
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
  <data key="d9">http://ceur-ws.org/Vol-1819/modsym2017-paper4.pdf; http://www.scitepress.org/DigitalLibrary/PublicationsDetail.aspx?ID=u0ub4mL3SHU%3d&amp;t=1; http://ceur-ws.org/Vol-1765/paper-05.pdf; http://www.scitepress.org/DigitalLibrary/Link.aspx?doi=10.5220/0005992401090116; https://doi.org/10.1145/3021460.3021469; http://2016.splashcon.org/event/agere2016-actor-monitors-for-adaptive-behaviour; http://www.springer.com/de/book/9783319483924; https://doi.org/10.1007/s12599-017-0516-y</data>
