                    Yonatan Aumann and Jérôme Lang and Ariel D. Procaccia
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
  <data key="d9">https://dx.doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.2887175; https://doi.org/10.24963/ijcai.2017/174; https://doi.org/10.24963/ijcai.2017/20</data>
  <data key="d10">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.6.6.10</data>
