                    Dorothea Baumeister, Piotr Faliszewski, and Annick Laruelle
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
  <data key="d9">https://ojs.aaai.org/index.php/AAAI/article/view/11478</data>
  <data key="d10">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.7.6.109</data>
