                    Penny Rheingans
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
  <data key="d9">https://hal.inria.fr/hal-01893153/document; https://doi.org/10.1109/TVCG.2018.2864849; https://www.springer.com/de/book/9783030344436; https://doi.org/10.1109/TVCG.2019.2934259</data>
