                    Stephanie Forrest, William B. Langdon, Claire Le Goues, and Justyna Petke
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
  <data key="d9">https://arxiv.org/abs/1901.02533; https://doi.org/10.1145/3194810.3194818; https://doi.org/10.1007/s00500-018-03705-6; https://doi.org/10.1007/s00500-018-03705-6; https://doi.org/10.1162/isal_a_00191; http://www-dept.cs.ucl.ac.uk/staff/W.Langdon/ftp/public/public/papers/langdon_RN2001.pdf; https://arxiv.org/abs/1902.09215v1; https://doi.org/10.1145/3286978.3287014; https://doi.org/10.1145/3194810.3194812; https://doi.org/10.1145/3205651.3208237</data>
