                    Onur Altintas, Suman Banerjee, Falko Dressler, Geert Heijenk, and Katrin Sjöberg
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
  <data key="d9">https://doi.org/10.1145/3331054.3331551; https://doi.org/10.1109/VNC.2018.8628408; https://doi.org/10.1007/978-981-13-0396-8_3; https://doi.org/10.1109/IVS.2019.8814110</data>
  <data key="d10">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.8.5.31</data>
