                    Piero Andrea Bonatti, Michael Cochez, Stefan Decker, Axel Polleres, and Valentina Presutti
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
  <data key="d9">https://arxiv.org/abs/2003.02320; https://doi.org/10.1145/3447772; https://doi.org/10.2200/S01125ED1V01Y202109DSK022; https://doi.org/10.1145/3418294</data>
