                    Jason Alexander, Petra Isenberg, Yvonne Jansen, Bernice E. Rogowitz, Andrew Vande Moere
                &lt;/img&gt;&lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
  <data key="d9">https://doi.org/10.1109/MCG.2019.2923483; https://doi.org/10.1080/13875868.2018.1531415; https://www.routledge.com/Making-with-Data-Physical-Design-and-Craft-in-a-Data-Driven-World/Huron-Nagel-Oehlberg-Willett/p/book/9781032182223#; https://www.routledge.com/Making-with-Data-Physical-Design-and-Craft-in-a-Data-Driven-World/Huron-Nagel-Oehlberg-Willett/p/book/9781032182223#; https://doi.org/10.1145/3617366</data>
  <data key="d10">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.8.10.127</data>
