                    Meinard Müller, Emilia Gómez, and Yi-Hsuan Yang
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
  <data key="d9">https://doi.org/10.5334/tismir.48; https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.3956666</data>
