                    Mario Gleirscher, Anne E. Haxthausen, Martin Leucker, and Sven Linker
                &lt;/img&gt;&lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
  <data key="d9">https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2305.13248</data>
  <data key="d10">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.9.10.95</data>
  <data key="d11">artificial intelligence / robotics; modelling / simulation; verification / logic</data>
