&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Petra Kralj Novak, Nada Lavrac, and Geoffrey I Webb. Supervised descriptive rule discovery: A unifying survey of contrast set, emerging pattern and subgroup mining. Journal of Machine Learning Research, 10(2), 2009.
&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt; 
 &lt;div&gt;
&lt;a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/de/deed.en"&gt;
