&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Fabian Klute and Martin Nöllenburg. Minimizing crossings in constrained two-sided circular graph layouts. In Symposium on Computational Geometry (SoCG 2018), volume 99 of LIPIcs, pages 53:1–53:14. Schloss Dagstuhl – Leibniz-Zentrum fuer Informatik, 2018.
