                    Philip Carns, Julian Kunkel, Kathryn Mohror, and Martin Schulz
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
  <data key="d9">https://doi.org/10.1109/PDSW54622.2021.00011; https://doi.org/10.1109/ICPADS60453.2023.00112; https://doi.org/10.1109/CLUSTERWorkshops65972.2025.11164197</data>
