  <data key="d9">https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2112.05642; https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2111.14611; https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2209.08311; https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2210.07871</data>
