&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; E. Ábrahám, J. Abbott, B. Becker, A.M. Bigatti, M. Brain, B. Buchberger, A. Cimatti, J.H. Davenport, M. England, P. Fontaine, S. Forrest, A. Griggio, D. Kroening, W.M. Seiler, and T. Sturm. SC2: Satisfiability checking meets symbolic computation. In M. Kohlhase, M. Johansson, B. Miller, L. de Moura, and F. Tompa, editors, Intelligent Computer Mathematics: Proceedings CICM 2016, volume 9791 of Lecture Notes in Computer Science, pages 28–43. Springer International Publishing, 2016. URL: https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-319-42547-4_3
