Innovating Personal Mobility. In Adjunct Proceedings of the 14th International Conference
on Automotive User Interfaces and Interactive Vehicular Applications (AutomotiveUI
’22). Association for Computing Machinery, New York, NY, USA, 215 – 218. &lt;a href="https:
//doi.org/10.1145/3544999.3551689"&gt;https:
//doi.org/10.1145/3544999.3551689&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt; 
