&lt;li&gt; Umer Farooq and Jonathan T Grudin. Paradigm shift from human computer interaction
to integration. In Proceedings of the 2017 CHI Conference Extended Abstracts on Human
Factors in Computing Systems, pages 1360–1363, 2017.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt; Lukas Gehrke, Pedro Lopes, and Klaus Gramann. Toward human augmentation using
neural fingerprints of affordances. In Affordances in Everyday Life: A Multidisciplinary
