                    Michael Gnewuch, Dmitriy Bilyk, Jan Vybíral, and Larisa Yaroslavtseva
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
  <data key="d9">https://www.ricam.oeaw.ac.at/files/reports/23/rep23-25.pdf; https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2309.09059; https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2310.12583; https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2401.00801; https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2402.02396; https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jco.2024.101883; https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jco.2024.101872; https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jco.2024.101870; https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jco.2024.101869; https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jco.2024.101856; https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jco.2024.101851; https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jco.2024.101840; https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jco.2024.101867; https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2501.13813; https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jmaa.2025.129873; https://doi.org/10.1090/mcom/4148</data>
  <data key="d10">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.13.8.106</data>
  <data key="d11">Computational Complexity; Data Structures and Algorithms; Numerical Analysis</data>
  <data key="d12">Tractability Analysis; Computational Stochastics; Infinite-Variate Problems; Quasi-Monte Carlo Methods; Sampling</data>
  <data key="d13">9116; 9242; 9442; 9643; 98201; 00391; 02401; 04401; 06391; 09391; 12391; 15391; 19341; 27341</data>
