                    Meinard Müller, Cynthia Liem,  and Brian McFee
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
  <data key="d9">https://doi.org/10.5334/tismir.238; https://doi.org/10.1109/ICASSP49660.2025.10889474; https://audiolabs-erlangen.de/resources/MIR/2025_DittmarZBSM_WindInstrumentSynth_ISMIR-LBD/2025_DittmarZBSM_WindInstrumentSynth_ISMIR-LBD.pdf</data>
